      "content": "Doubbling your caffeine or adding Monster Energy drinks is a dangerous idea that will likely make your ADHD symptoms worse, not better. Your brain is already overstimulated by Ritalin, and stacking stimulants on top of them is a recipe for severe anxiety, heart palpitations, and total mental fog. Instead of risking a crash that will ruin your finals, you should stick to your prescribed dosage and maybe try a quick walk to reset your focus.",
