    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like my current dose isn't really cutting it lately though... like i can sit down to work but i just cant stay focused for more than 10 mins. if i just took like a couple of caffeine pills in the morning it might give me that extra kick i need to actually get through my notes. i've heard people do it all the time to study harder. wouldn't it just be like a little extra boost?",
