    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay cool. i'm a bit nervous about my heart racing though, i've felt it tap dance in my chest a few times when i drink too much coffee. should i just push through that or like, is there a way to take it so i don't get the jitters? like maybe i should take more than two pills if i feel like i'm crashing midday?",
